Package: linux-image-4.19.325-samsung-r8q
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G
 r8q Halium/Droidian port.
 .
 Note: this package only ships the kernel image and modules. Use the
 linux-bootimage package for an Android boot image with the Halium initramfs.

Package: linux-bootimage-4.19.325-samsung-r8q
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-image-4.19.325-samsung-r8q (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G - Android Boot Image
 This package contains an Android boot image for the Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G
 r8q Halium/Droidian port. The image includes the Halium initramfs.

